	(text "Input debounce circuit\nAt 3.3V (V0), rising edge trigger level (VT+) is ~2V (60%)\nTime t = -RC * ln(1 - VT / V0)\n10kΩ / 100nF gives ~1ms, sufficient for reed contacts\n10kΩ /   1µF gives ~10ms, longer time, e.g. for pushbuttons\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
